{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31046","headline":"下第後夷门乘舟至永城驿题 · 薛能","name":"下第後夷门乘舟至永城驿题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋赋春还计尽违，自知身是拙求知。\n唯思旷海爲休处，忽喜孤舟似去时。\n连浦一城兼汴宋，夹堤千柳杂唐隋。\n从来此恨皆前达，敢负吾君作楚辞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31046.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31046","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}